    "id": "aperivue/medsci-skills/mllm-eval",
    "name": "mllm-eval",
    "description": "Design or audit a model-agnostic evaluation harness for an LLM or multimodal LLM on a clinical task (radiology report generation, visual question answering, clinical text extraction/classification) — the adjudicated reference standard, clinical-efficacy metrics (RadGraph-F1 / CheXbert-F1 beyond BLEU/ROUGE), faithfulness and hallucination, pretraining-contamination of public benchmarks, prompt-sensitivity and determinism, answer-matching, and a reader study — and gate the plan for those axes. Works on a closed API or open weights. Never fabricates outputs or scores, and never reports n-gram overlap as clinical correctness.\n",
